SUMMARY:State Game Lands 220 Field Trip
DESCRIPTION:Carl Groff will lead a field trip to State Game Lands (SGL) No. 220 to search for late migrants and early winter arrivals. Some of the target birds include any lingering warblers\, White-crowned Sparrow\, Purple Finch\, Chipping Sparrow\, Fox Sparrow\, Blue-headed and Philadelphia Vireos\, and maybe a surprise or two.  Meet at 8 a.m. at the SGL No. 220 parking lot located along Swamp Church Road just outside of Reinholds. GPS coordinates for parking lot are: 40.272869\, -76.119807. No restrooms available. Contact Carl at fledge19@verizon.net or 717-471-9969 if you have questions or want to make a reservation to attend. \n  \n\nLocation: SGL 220 Parking Lot\, Near 115 Swamp Church Road\, Reinholds\, Pa\, 17569 \nContact: Carl Groff\, 717-471-9969 or fledge19@verizon.net 
URL:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/event/state-game-lands-220-field-trip/
LOCATION:State Game Lands 220 – Swamp Church Rd Parking Lot\, 115 Swamp Church Rd (vicinity)\, Reinholds\, PA\, 17569\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/lancaster-county-birds-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
